fn main() {
    let s = String::from("Hello");

    print_string(s.clone()); // heap data clone
    println!("After function call: {}", s);
}

fn print_string(s1: String) {
    println!("Inside function: {}", s1);
}


s.clone() → नया heap allocation

Heap में दो "Hello" बन गए

Memory waste हो सकती है (large data में)

Stack             Heap
-----             -----
s   ───────────▶ "Hello"
s1  ───────────▶ "Hello" (clone)
